// SR 814.20 — Title 3 Enforcement, Provision of Fundamentals, Promotional Measures and Procedures
// generated by src/parse.py. Do not edit by hand.

:NOTE
Amended by No I of the FA of 20 June 1997, in force since 1 Nov. 1997 (AS 1997 2243; BBl 1996 IV 1217).
